{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "the-naked-director-s01e07-scene-05",
  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "お互い自分のやり方で金集めようぜ  (Let's Each Raise Money Our Own Way)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "kawada": "川田",
    "toshi": "トシ"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Alone in the office, Kawada pitches releasing Kuroki's shelved debut video through a booming retail chain, while Toshi argues for selling uncensored tapes underground through Furuya.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "黒木君の作品を発売する。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "販売ルートはどうすんだよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "今店舗を増やして急成長してる店に掛け合ってみるんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "あんなえたいの知れねえもんが売れんのかよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "分からないよ。でも勝負をかける価値はあると思う。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "気乗りしねえな。あの女に命は懸けられねえよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "じゃあどうやって金集めるんだよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "古谷さんと手組んで、うちの作品を裏で流す。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "バカ言うなよ、摘発されたら終わるぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ダメだ、ヤクザは信用できない。リスクが高すぎるんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おっさんの命が懸かってんだろうが！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "お互い自分のやり方で金集めようぜ。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "黒木君の作品を発売する。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We are going to release Kuroki's film.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "販売ルートはどうすんだよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What are you going to do about a sales channel?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "今店舗を増やして急成長してる店に掛け合ってみるんだ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I will negotiate with a chain that is adding stores and growing fast right now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "あんなえたいの知れねえもんが売れんのかよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Will something that strange actually sell?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "分からないよ。でも勝負をかける価値はあると思う。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't know. Still, I think it is worth staking our shot on.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "気乗りしねえな。あの女に命は懸けられねえよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am not feeling it. I can't stake Muranishi's life on that girl.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "じゃあどうやって金集めるんだよ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then how else do you plan to gather the money?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "古谷さんと手組んで、うちの作品を裏で流す。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Team up with Furuya and distribute our films underground.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "バカ言うなよ、摘発されたら終わるぞ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Don't talk nonsense, if we get raided it is all over.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kawada",
      "t": "ダメだ、ヤクザは信用できない。リスクが高すぎるんだよ！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No way, we cannot trust the yakuza. The risk is far too high!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "おっさんの命が懸かってんだろうが！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The boss's life is hanging on the line here!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "toshi",
      "t": "お互い自分のやり方で金集めようぜ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let's each raise the money using our own methods.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
